            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f2" n="1" xml:id="d204-f2-content">
                <p>At 11 a.m., October 11, the President met with Rusk, McNamara, Lemnitzer,
                        Allen Dulles, Cottrell, Donald M. Wilson
                    of USIA, Bissell, Ball, Gilpatric, and McGeorge Bundy. The meeting lasted until 12:25 p.m. and was
                    characterized as “off the record.” (Ibid., President’s Appointment Book) For
                    additional information, see <ref target="#d205">Document 205</ref>.</p>
            </note>
